                <syl /><neume facs="#m-508b5e5c-9fee-4390-a928-bc2107b9dc8f" type="virga" xml:id="m-f6bc46d5-dab5-4f8c-98b4-d434a1d7567e">
                  <nc xml:id="m-152293da-3594-41a4-9347-a604be10fe24" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-638c079f-4e9a-4b49-9175-f2e5ad56604c">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-8e1b9d2c-a4e8-4637-8f0b-b75baa507776" type="punctum" xml:id="m-df8b6db9-fb34-4cde-88d8-5c5034a7c37d">
                  <nc xml:id="m-93752c47-6ce4-4701-b0bd-e6b163a0344c" pname="a" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-bbc2ba0c-9cf3-4c30-a067-22191915ba0b">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-d788cf8a-aaf5-414e-8f96-ba75a1a5bcbc" type="punctum" xml:id="m-395c02fb-1334-41bd-a9b5-7cbc68a8326b">
                  <nc xml:id="m-566fd316-fdd2-4783-9b47-d092e07a8f77" pname="f" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-f1e0d8d6-a2ae-456c-ae3c-bf633ad81b65" facs="#m-057214c8-3d06-49d2-9e14-14cea61734be" form="minima" /><custos xml:id="m-5573d8a0-9ca9-4d45-9ed8-48e3649ba1e9" facs="#m-c4172705-07f8-4ed6-8cb3-460a2c437549" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-1de3ba0c-bb4e-4bcf-8e1b-1cdd9e314640">
            <lg xml:id="m-c817a70b-f21f-4e5c-bc22-ab1bb706e588">
              <l xml:id="m-cd33561f-0bed-4001-8e85-f4813ea1203d" facs="#m-a0585024-e007-4d49-b987-b0d9d9387273" label="ambiguous">Ianuary 25.</l><l xml:id="m-efaea9d6-7e1b-4a0b-add4-2030ffc41eae" facs="#m-01a6634a-f02a-4bf9-b8a8-d80dd4b51313" label="ambiguous">1348</l><l xml:id="m-9cf62549-9075-48c0-b804-f1a095bfb8f7" facs="#m-65215c35-263c-40b4-96af-f58825cda885" label="lyrics-like">non videns, et non manducávit, ne- meo pati. Et ábiit Ananías, et in¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c96b520-7bdb-4b43-8c1a-90a8ad55f4de" facs="#m-cd331e1e-2f53-4905-85b5-0402d3092f8a" label="lyrics-like">que bibit. Érat autem quidam discí¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e065f29-a86c-457c-9285-5bbd726219c4" facs="#m-46bd1d99-1261-44a4-a94c-8262bbd390c4" label="lyrics-like">trosvit in domum : et impónens ei</l><l xml:id="m-66734ea5-6428-40d9-a3ff-a5691d35fb3e" facs="#m-ec0affe2-664a-4960-bb4e-1d070ae22818" label="lyrics-like">pulus Damásci, nómine Ananías:</l><l xml:id="m-54b6774b-88ba-44c1-ba51-2ed077272f2a" facs="#m-26372c06-17af-4256-b07b-5614db880459" label="lyrics-like">manus, dixit : Saule frater, Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-6513d7e6-7f1e-446f-97e9-6341a2bdc195" facs="#m-b9a97a8f-15c8-4f08-8e78-b8eebe8d6ae9" label="lyrics-like">et dixit ad illum in visu Dõminus:</l><l xml:id="m-ea007487-e1e8-4d0e-b7ae-0062b166cdd0" facs="#m-4d4f4d35-7794-4d29-9e6c-de7614e56788" label="lyrics-like">misit me Jesus, qui appáruit tibi in</l><l xml:id="m-adbb0578-ffd9-4756-97a3-43ac4062de75" facs="#m-a94cee5e-a577-4677-aa02-e831e07d1b00" label="lyrics-like">Ananía. At ille ait : Ecce ego, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-53a2bfc4-adaf-4f44-afdc-70cb156608ca" facs="#m-cd92f20b-84d2-4767-aac9-9e8e4eb3f47e" label="lyrics-like">via, qua veniébas, ut videas, et im¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a182044-9cbd-4a19-a45c-63fd9654c5bc" facs="#m-f518c821-f71c-43a4-9238-851726bc5eab" label="lyrics-like">mine. Et Dóminus ad eum: Surge,</l><l xml:id="m-2d477d1b-696f-4c50-8ba4-7c0070237b69" facs="#m-1db074e7-5411-4ede-893b-df7c1782e9de" label="lyrics-like">pleáris Spiritu Sancto. Et conféstim</l><l xml:id="m-fe53dc2c-fa28-4e08-8b4b-5b6a5d24d171" facs="#m-e7c0bc7d-cd8f-4baa-9096-b8c767a07bed" label="lyrics-like">cecidérunt ab óculis ejus tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-43869ec2-e85d-4fda-b4f7-f0526e04c1cb" facs="#m-916d1af2-3ba0-4c48-af5b-6048fbdae34c" label="lyrics-like">et vade in vicum qui vocátur Re¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bee5957-36c8-44fe-8db9-0f866589f460" facs="#m-74e1ba83-14ae-4e79-b7f2-8a3812540088" label="ambiguous">ctus, et quaere in domo Judae Sau¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9463c7d-a847-4e09-aab3-1638d0820c91" facs="#m-27eca1d7-5316-41aa-b952-9a800a477dea" label="lyrics-like">squamae, et visum recépit: et sur¬</l><l xml:id="m-72ed534a-acbe-409e-b46f-6fbc3f3d1e36" facs="#m-d564531a-d362-482f-974c-de334beda0ce" label="lyrics-like">lum nómine Tarsénsem : ecce enim</l><l xml:id="m-addb7fc0-fb8e-4113-a6ce-d77d0172b669" facs="#m-28d9ac67-6e88-4ed8-9d5e-6d203dd2c3eb" label="lyrics-like">gens baptizátus est. Et cum accepis¬</l><l xml:id="m-e52f337c-1064-46a4-8b0f-527411d20ad6" facs="#m-6e3f43bd-60cf-403d-8425-a06ac03bd2b9" label="lyrics-like">orat. (Et vidit virum, Ananíam</l><l xml:id="m-b6bebc90-9a9a-4898-8f9a-5214e0147124" facs="#m-ca03732e-54bd-4487-8482-cab33648a551" label="lyrics-like">set cibum, confortátus est. Fuit au¬</l><l xml:id="m-73f0305e-05cb-4bdb-bf67-3c3c658161cc" facs="#m-edafcfe0-2134-44e4-8435-19dcda60799d" label="lyrics-like">nómine, introeúntem et imponén¬</l><l xml:id="m-37af0d9a-e1e4-4d5e-9618-f52babe81526" facs="#m-45b0433e-6acc-4b75-ad94-5e2469ee76f5" label="ambiguous">tem cum discipulis qui erant Da¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9c32313-1275-48d2-bc9f-7d7b7e778e8b" facs="#m-417a9ffe-7688-4a11-be9f-48b4e06b82f2" label="lyrics-like">másci, per dies áliquot. Et continuo</l><l xml:id="m-defda92d-e5c5-4092-97a8-9d4c3dec427d" facs="#m-ae90b7a2-f07f-4e99-bbc1-f478ce7f89dc" label="ambiguous">tem sibi manus, ut visum recipiat.)</l><l xml:id="m-33b6069b-9f5f-48b5-ad91-bac32f00bd45" facs="#m-81fe94bd-33db-4323-97e4-eb76b4816d7f" label="lyrics-like">Respóndit autem Ananias: Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-97204fc7-6d49-44d9-85c5-97dd46d22696" facs="#m-9b2af8d6-7276-4d53-8f35-666d3cfce424" label="lyrics-like">in synagógis praedicábat Jesum,</l><l xml:id="m-b4322f64-b1c7-49c1-a261-ba1b7e090ee3" facs="#m-bb7d5d6c-be19-44bf-b7f0-3db3327d4d11" label="ambiguous">ne, audivi a multis de viro hoc,</l><l xml:id="m-1000639b-c693-4713-8d75-570cd41503a4" facs="#m-d6f6e3f8-0634-418d-9af3-16ea8a6e0e1b" label="lyrics-like">quóniam hic est Filius Dei. Stupé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1ba0aef-80bd-4159-97e3-39c6c14cc763" facs="#m-85d4b02d-29d4-4eaf-909e-58b2fa95b41e" label="lyrics-like">quanta mala fécerit sanctis tuis in</l><l xml:id="m-711b3510-ca02-4195-8f7a-a18f2d58a2d6" facs="#m-3c49c6c6-6955-446f-b04f-8d0d2024cbbd" label="lyrics-like">bant autem omnes qui audiébant,</l><l xml:id="m-bb9940ac-1c95-4b36-b233-600d90d34e59" facs="#m-b6dc6699-3d55-4d82-9d27-f439bd4d63ee" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem; et hic habet potestátem</l><l xml:id="m-b3b9ce4f-6d8a-44e4-bffa-a6a100102a0b" facs="#m-96cb6062-e3eb-444e-8441-906b03573012" label="lyrics-like">et dicébant: Nonne hic est, qui ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0378885-69e0-45bb-b676-4e1c5820ecc8" facs="#m-894bbfcd-f38b-4297-a057-eee7cea5a999" label="lyrics-like">pugnábat in Jerúsalem eos qui in¬</l><l xml:id="m-0526ebfc-1f4d-4140-93da-fb3c8527f7d6" facs="#m-1c99be83-69f7-481d-969d-7aa2a47caca2" label="lyrics-like">à principibus sacerdótum alligándi</l><l xml:id="m-ac72f510-1a19-4b2d-a4ee-93cbd75f154c" facs="#m-c9971639-6325-479a-ac33-c574b66844eb" label="lyrics-like">vocábant nomen istud : et huc ad</l><l xml:id="m-33e4c3bf-f648-4b76-a476-dd1e9c1ed600" facs="#m-c52a9c6a-6183-429d-a4f1-285448610eea" label="lyrics-like">omnes qui ínvocant nomen tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-fb59aa36-f357-4e05-ba52-ee4fe98ef21f" facs="#m-501da4eb-656d-48eb-b7c1-456ba169ba94" label="lyrics-like">Dixit autem ad eum Dóminus:</l><l xml:id="m-277caa08-f004-4cdf-8bd1-7ebeb7fad6e7" facs="#m-0f25d058-ddec-4a69-963e-fa8fea48ee2e" label="lyrics-like">hoc venit, ut vinctos illos dúceret</l><l xml:id="m-7adf20af-89a4-4df8-83c0-e8222f92b592" facs="#m-dbcda16c-9eed-4003-8d15-b53c0950908b" label="lyrics-like">Vade, quóniam vas electiónis est</l><l xml:id="m-c4d7d324-9821-4c3b-aa04-f651706d3d37" facs="#m-eed750b2-7c29-499a-9b10-95fb49a58ddf" label="lyrics-like">ad principes sacerdótum? Saulus</l><l xml:id="m-81dd0391-d533-4222-beb3-3555dc6573dd" facs="#m-ca94cfdb-efc2-40fb-9fbc-50aa3843227a" label="ambiguous">mihi iste, ut portet nomen meum</l><l xml:id="m-6e6e16f5-57d5-401b-8526-00567879b7b6" facs="#m-fc93f869-3a47-4c08-b0f6-8086a99b4148" label="lyrics-like">autem multo magis convalescébat,</l><l xml:id="m-553e0130-ea78-48e0-80c6-049d9876658b" facs="#m-2eb5b3ab-41b9-4d7a-9b98-5cc344722010" label="lyrics-like">et confundébat Judaéos qui habitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d55bc4b-51b3-4551-a59b-bd7df4b05126" facs="#m-28307946-57c3-4a2d-9963-60089fe652c5" label="lyrics-like">coram géntibus, et régibus, et flliis</l><l xml:id="m-b9a242b9-6a79-4022-9567-41d5d88022ac" facs="#m-e78d22f3-ad91-48c0-be6b-dd2e17c9f1b2" label="lyrics-like">bant Damásci, affirmans quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-eef0fa16-d0c3-4faa-bbbb-56e743f46170" facs="#m-96c551fb-ef98-4c8c-8ccd-141a1fce6792" label="lyrics-like">Israel. Ego enim osténdam illi,</l><l xml:id="m-452cc0b1-64b3-4cbc-a56d-9ec939e3d426" facs="#m-2f178fcc-f691-4ed7-b6f6-bf0fa6506743" label="lyrics-like">quanta opórteat eum pro nómine! hic est Christus.</l><l xml:id="m-6fb84332-92fe-4b1d-8e1a-1e55842a7bf5" facs="#m-a1940041-185c-4ec1-98dd-26eb123105f9" label="ambiguous">Grad. E</l><l xml:id="m-5f03688f-326f-4360-bb57-eb22cdc04a42" facs="#m-4f19666f-234f-467b-8038-a92f776ea8e8" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-c358cbc5-44de-4b15-af5e-39bcce968c68" facs="#m-2f76bad5-2b7e-48a8-9b7f-425ed30948b5" label="lyrics-like">UI ope-rá-tus est</l><l xml:id="m-a92a45ba-878a-4ed9-97ec-db35dfefd5c8" facs="#m-a62cdd1f-6177-448e-af83-0d08145e3848" label="lyrics-like">Pétro</l><l xml:id="m-db9ae20e-1ec7-43b5-9649-d42a7f64ced2" facs="#m-91bf3e65-a337-44bb-a5fc-ab8b049d1bd6" label="ambiguous">in apo¬</l><l xml:id="m-959c1be9-133f-4d03-94f8-216d56fea184" facs="#m-15931c77-730e-4326-bbad-c5a16b760ab5" label="lyrics-like">est et mí¬ hi</l><l xml:id="m-ac6e26b2-33e6-401e-9cfd-86b86af1f2c2" facs="#m-b461bea7-3f60-4054-9d46-96d5aca6ab2b" label="lyrics-like">sto-látum,</l><l xml:id="m-b5eaa141-58bc-4cb8-bfef-eb7d99dcd2c7" facs="#m-2fe27e6a-4d89-4155-97fd-f2b801270611" label="lyrics-like">operá-tus</l><l xml:id="m-2d7c5255-999c-49fd-8509-9334b4bf8058" facs="#m-3c347784-da1b-4a8c-aed4-c972062086ca" label="ambiguous">ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-bfc2a33b-24d6-45e9-9929-b43449989cdd" facs="#m-765d81ca-8536-45df-a230-09f743e5618d" label="lyrics-like">inter gén-tes: et cognové- runt</l><l xml:id="m-1eeb7290-860d-4974-a6e3-7ef8f5a1b3e6" facs="#m-ad232541-6795-443a-9529-ee2440243505" label="lyrics-like">grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3d480c9-04fd-4df7-9012-1befe0cdd9f4" facs="#m-95d7ca2a-e47a-48b7-af88-8ed6df02f60c" label="ambiguous">am</l><l xml:id="m-4eae3702-0ed7-49b8-a502-a4f82dab6319" facs="#m-f3d521b2-0f1a-41f9-a1f4-52f157bba15b" label="ambiguous">hi.</l><l xml:id="m-cad215e2-aef1-4195-b5bc-f660a0f080fd" facs="#m-227812ed-5709-4fee-a181-485d56adc72f" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba24481c-c860-4c8e-93c8-c815643f4545" facs="#m-070b57d0-68bf-41c3-aa36-7d633a952c3b" label="lyrics-like">i, quae dá-ta est mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab9046b4-aea8-4731-8a69-ee0fc374080c" facs="#m-8364964f-9ac0-4f55-bb94-0fa015003161" label="lyrics-like">V.Grá-ti-a Dé¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
